<%- include("partials/header", { title, pageStylesheet }) %>

<section class="page-heading">
    <span class="tag">ASSESSMENT 04</span>
    <h1>Blink and Fatigue Monitoring</h1>
    <p>
        The webcam records your eye-openness over time to measure blink frequency
        and closure duration. This is an experimental measurement, not a medical test.
    </p>
</section>

<section class="card eye-instructions">
    <h2>Before you begin</h2>
    <ol>
        <li>Allow camera access and position your face comfortably in view.</li>
        <li>Keep your face centered so both eyes remain visible in the preview.</li>
        <li>Keep your eyes naturally open and blink normally.</li>
        <li>Do <strong>not</strong> deliberately change your blinking pattern.</li>
        <li>Read the passage and blink naturally while monitoring runs.</li>
    </ol>
    <p>The recording lasts about 30 seconds. Keep this browser page open to see progress and results.</p>
</section>

<section
    id="blinkMonitoringTest"
    class="card eye-test-runner"
    data-assessment-id="<%= assessment._id %>"
    data-gaze-ws-url="<%= gazeWsUrl %>"
>
    <div class="eye-runner-heading">
        <div>
            <h2>Ready when you are</h2>
            <p>Assessment for <strong><%= assessment.name %></strong></p>
        </div>
        <a href="/eye-assessment/<%= assessment._id %>">Back to assessments</a>
    </div>

    <div class="eye-runner-actions">
        <button class="btn" type="button" id="startBlinkTest">Start Test</button>
        <button class="eye-cancel-button" type="button" id="cancelBlinkTest" hidden>
            Cancel Test
        </button>
    </div>

    <p id="blinkStatus" class="eye-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">
        Ready. The webcam starts only after you click Start Test.
    </p>

    <div id="blinkStage" class="eye-gaze-stage eye-blink-stage">
        <canvas id="blinkSignalCanvas" aria-label="Live measured eye openness signal"></canvas>
        <video id="blinkVideo" autoplay muted playsinline aria-hidden="true"></video>
        <div class="eye-camera-preview blink-eye-preview">
            <canvas id="blinkEyePreview" aria-label="Cropped eye view with live facial landmarks"></canvas>
            <span>LIVE EYE LANDMARKS</span>
        </div>
        <span class="eye-gaze-live-indicator" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <p id="blinkStageMessage" class="eye-gaze-stage-message">
            Start the test to read the paragraph while your blinking is measured.
        </p>
        <article id="blinkReadingParagraph" class="blink-reading-paragraph" hidden>
            <h3>Read this passage naturally</h3>
            <p>
                Small moments can make an ordinary day feel memorable. Morning light
                enters the room, a warm drink is prepared, and the familiar sounds of
                the neighborhood begin outside. Later, a short walk offers a chance
                to notice the changing sky, the trees along the path, and the steady
                rhythm of footsteps. When we give an activity our attention, simple
                details are often easier to appreciate. Take your time reading, and
                blink as you normally would.
            </p>
        </article>
        <div class="blink-live-readout">
            <span>Current average EAR</span>
            <strong id="blinkEarReadout">--</strong>
        </div>
    </div>
    <p class="eye-gaze-camera">
        <span id="blinkCameraStatus">Camera Off</span>
        <span id="blinkFaceStatus">Waiting for the test to start.</span>
    </p>

    <div class="eye-progress-track" role="progressbar" aria-label="Blink monitoring progress" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" aria-valuenow="0">
        <div id="blinkProgress" class="eye-progress-fill"></div>
    </div>
    <p id="blinkProgressText" class="eye-progress-text">0%</p>
</section>

<p class="disclaimer">
    This experimental monitoring feature does not detect, diagnose, or confirm any medical condition.
    Blink measurements depend on lighting, glasses, and camera framing.
</p>

<script src="/js/eye-tests/blink-monitoring.js?v=eye-visibility-2" defer></script>
<%- include("partials/footer") %>